SUBJECT:
Contract Modification #1 to Reiman Corp, for the Carey Avenue Multi Use Path
project.
Please find the attached proposed contract modification for the above referenced city project.
Construction and Engineering Staff have discussed the additional work and materials required to
remedy the unforeseen conflicts with the existing irrigation system and have determined that it is
in the City's best interest to increase to total contract amount of this project. The additional costs
associated with this modification arenot to exceed Twenty-Nine Thousand Four Hundred Eighty-
Four Dollars and Zero Cents ($29,484.00). There will be no change to the contract completion
date.Staff respectfully requests your approval of this contract modification.
```

### Page 2 of 5

```text
CITY OF CHEYENNE
CONTRACT MODIFICATION
Contract Modification:
# 1
Project:
Carey Avenue Multi Use Path
Project Number:
Contract #7430
Contractor:
Reiman Corp.
Date Prepared:
January 24, 2022
The above referenced contract is amended or modified as set forth in the following and these
amendments and modifications of the plans and specifications are agreed to by the parties. All
other aspects of the original agreement remain unchanged and in full force and effect.

I. Description of Changes
This contract modification is to provide additional funding for unforeseen complications with the
existing irrigation system.
II. New Contract Items
There is no change in the scope of work however, a quote has been included for the required
changes that reflect negotiated, reduced pricing due to an increase in item quantities
($19,484.00). We anticipate similar complications as this project progresses and therefore are
requesting an additional $10,000.00 over the quoted amount for a total of $29,484.00. These
funds will be added to the balance of the existing Force Account. Itemized billing against this
line item will be required for each pay request as necessary.

III. Schedule
There will be no impact to the completion date of this contract.
IV. Summary
Original Contract Amount .........................................................$806,008.55
Previous Modifications .........................................................................$0.00
Contract Amount Prior to this Modification ..............................$806,008.55
This Modification.........................................................................$29,484.00
New Contract Amount ...............................................................$835,492.55

V. Approvals
City of Cheyenne
Date: January 24, 2022________
