Patrick Collins, Mayor
/ATTEST: Kristina F. Jones, City Clerk

______________________________/_______________________________________
Accepted by Engineer

/Recommend approval by City Project Manager
By Stefanie Boster at 3:09 pm, Mar 07, 2022
